      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This report presents the rationale and methodology of our \"phase 1 1/2\" model for drug evaluation and reports the results of a typical study. We found that Ro 20-2230, and investigational agonist-antagonist analgesic, was well tolerated in therapeutic doses, with 15 mg intramuscular Ro 20-2230 approximately equivalent to 10 mg intramuscular morphine sulfate."},
